    "text": "<p>Let A be a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math> real matrix such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. Then, the system <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> has</p>",
